{"id":"b4de3484ad8d9669","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-permutable.md","title":"Permutable Congruences","display":"df-permutable — Permutable Congruences","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-permutable","aliases":["93-df-permutable"],"display":"df-permutable — Permutable Congruences","depends_on":["[[93-df-congruence]]","[[58-df-relation-composition]]","[[93-df-variety]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-permutable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-permutable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-permutable — Permutable Congruences"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7e70202d5fff2308\" href=\"?note=7e70202d5fff2308\" title=\"58-df-relation-composition\">58-df-relation-composition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf{A})\">\\(\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf{A})\\)</span> (congruences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\circ\\phi=\\{\\langle a,c\\rangle:\\exists b\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\phi\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in\\theta)\\}\">\\(\\theta\\circ\\phi=\\{\\langle a,c\\rangle:\\exists b\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\phi\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in\\theta)\\}\\)</span> is relation composition from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7e70202d5fff2308\" href=\"?note=7e70202d5fff2308\" title=\"58-df-relation-composition\">58-df-relation-composition</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Permutable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Permutable}\\)</span> (permutability predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}\\)</span> is the sourced type-indexed variety predicate, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}\\)</span> is the congruence-permutability predicate defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}permutable}\\vdash \\mathrm{Permutable}(\\theta,\\phi;\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta\\circ\\phi=\\phi\\circ\\theta\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}permutable}\\vdash \\mathrm{Permutable}(\\theta,\\phi;\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta\\circ\\phi=\\phi\\circ\\theta\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}permutable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n\\mathrm{Permutable}(\\theta,\\phi;\\mathbf A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}permutable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n\\mathrm{Permutable}(\\theta,\\phi;\\mathbf A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Relation composition is a binary operation on subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^2\">\\(A^2\\)</span> and is not the four-place categorical composition predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a57fde3586b9e79c\" href=\"?note=a57fde3586b9e79c\" title=\"93-df-composition\">93-df-composition</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-relation-composition","status":"resolved","id":"7e70202d5fff2308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-relation-composition]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf{A})$ (congruences, see [[93-df-congruence]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-relation-composition","status":"resolved","id":"7e70202d5fff2308","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta\\circ\\phi=\\{\\langle a,c\\rangle:\\exists b\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\phi\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in\\theta)\\}$ is relation composition from [[58-df-relation-composition]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-composition","status":"resolved","id":"a57fde3586b9e79c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Relation composition is a binary operation on subsets of $A^2$ and is not the four-place categorical composition predicate of [[93-df-composition]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf{A})","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\circ\\phi=\\{\\langle a,c\\rangle:\\exists b\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in\\phi\\land\\langle b,c\\rangle\\in\\theta)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Permutable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}permutable}\\vdash \\mathrm{Permutable}(\\theta,\\phi;\\mathbf A)\\leftrightarrow\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta\\circ\\phi=\\phi\\circ\\theta","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}permutable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Variety}_{93}(\\mathcal V;\\tau)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall\\theta,\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n\\mathrm{Permutable}(\\theta,\\phi;\\mathbf A)","display":true},{"tex":"A^2","display":false}],"bytes":1441,"backlinks":[{"id":"f9827304d8968c8c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CPerm}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{MalcevTerm}_{93}$ are the predicates of [[93-df-permutable]] and [[93-df-malcev-term]]."},{"id":"30dce33330cca251","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Permutable}$ is the typed congruence-permutability predicate of [[93-df-permutable]]."},{"id":"50ca0f1caf2e947c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Permutable}$ is the typed predicate of [[93-df-permutable]]."},{"id":"d9c7505f9ccdb5ad","an